  - Human Microbiome Project
abstract: >
  Reproducible analysis scripts for a reference-database comparison of 16S rRNA
  gene amplicon profiles from burial soils of the New York African Burial Ground
  (72 burial samples from 47 burials, 6 non-burial control soils) against the
  Earth Microbiome Project (17,482 samples) and Human Microbiome Project (4,743
  samples) at genus level. Includes full-depth denoising, depth-matched FEAST
  source tracking, indicator species and source networks, ANCOM-BC2 and ALDEx2
  consensus, cross-validated classifiers with an empirical null, laboratory-control
  decontamination, mixed models of the anatomical proximity trend, and the
  figure code for the revised manuscript.
